 "reason": "AMENDMENT_11_v13 section 6, B1r: constants and code, frozen before any fresh value under them. Stage 1 (sigma_a2 down to 1e-9): no sign change, median plateau 1.6663 (out/b3/B4_TUNE_STAGE1_v02.json). Identity test of trk_tracker_v02 (out/b3/KCA_IDENTITY_v02.json): 44 of 44 identical (kappa_ca absent: B4 and B1 arrays of the 20 lead-braking tuning runs bit-identical to v01; kappa_ca = 1.0 on 2 runs). Stage 2 (out/b3/B4_TUNE_STAGE2_v02.json): kappa_ca = 0.6401032024709309, median NIS 1.9978 in [1.8, 2.2] (first sign change between j = 3 and 4, bisection). Constants out/b3/B1R_CONSTANTS_v02.json (kappa 0.16788, sigma_a2 0.001, kappa_ca 0.6401). Code: b_b1r_v02.py (P-bar on the 120 tuning runs; fresh re-track gated on LOCK_A10_2, LOCK_A10_2c and LOCK_A11), b_fresh_analysis_v03.py (+B1R/IMMr, gated on LOCK_A11; test-old B1 reproduces v01 89 of 89), b_fresh_export_v04.py (+B.IMMr.*, existing keys must stay identical), imm_compare_v02.py (kappa_ca; old-run check with kappa_ca 0.5: P9 rel 1.6e-14, ids identical), b_step0_export_v01.py, make_freeze_add_v03.py (this tool: reads the data-only add7 layer; also covers B_retrack/pods/*.py, the RunPod recount tooling of 20 Nov). Second programs (Claude Sonnet, from the spec/A11, without B's code): imm2/imm2_v02.py + README_imm2_v02.md (kappa_ca on Q_CA entries 0,1,2,6,7,8; byte-identical to imm2_v01 without it), recount_fresh/immr_v03.py (old-run test as IMM: 26 of 26 keys and 2,000 rows bit-equal; fresh mode gated on all three locks). No library change since add6.",
